"Fn works alone or with Shift, Control, Option or Command, pressed before or after Fn. While Fn is held, adding a modifier switches the recording to that shortcut; releasing one does not. Fn with letter keys is not available because macOS reserves those 🌐 shortcuts." = "Fn 可以单独使用，也可以与 Shift、Control、Option 或 Command 组合，修饰键在 Fn 之前或之后按下均可。按住 Fn 时，再按下修饰键会把当前录音切换到对应的快捷键；松开修饰键不会切换。macOS 保留了 🌐 与字母键的组合，因此不支持 Fn 加字母键。";
