"Fn shortcuts, alone or with modifier keys, need ‘Press Fn (🌐) key to’ set to ‘Do Nothing’ in System Settings → Keyboard. Otherwise recording can also switch input sources, open emoji or start Dictation. This system-wide setting stays in effect after VoiceDraft quits." = "使用 Fn 快捷键（单独或与修饰键组合）时，需要在系统设置 → 键盘中将“按 Fn（🌐）键”设为“不执行任何操作”，否则录音时可能同时切换输入法、打开表情或启动系统听写。这是系统级设置，退出 VoiceDraft 后也会保留。";
"Open Keyboard Settings" = "打开键盘设置";

// On-screen context
"On-screen context" = "屏幕上下文";
"Use on-screen text as context" = "使用屏幕上的文字作为上下文";
"When you dictate into another app, VoiceDraft reads the text visible in that app's front window. Names and terms help recognition, and a short excerpt near your cursor helps the writing model. Nothing is saved or synced." = "当你向其他应用口述时，VoiceDraft 会读取该应用前台窗口中可见的文字。名称和术语有助于识别，光标附近的一小段摘录则有助于写作模型。不会保存或同步任何内容。";
"Recognition hints" = "识别提示";
"Sends up to 300 names and terms from the screen to your speech model. The full text is never sent to speech recognition." = "最多将屏幕上的 300 个名称和术语发送给你的语音模型。完整文字绝不会发送给语音识别。";
"Writing reference" = "写作参考";
"Sends up to 1,500 characters near your cursor to your writing model so it can match names, terms and tone. It never adds this text to your result." = "最多将光标附近的 1,500 个字符发送给你的写作模型，以便匹配名称、术语和语气。这些文字绝不会加入你的结果。";
"Read the window with OCR when an app exposes no text" = "应用不暴露文字时用 OCR 读取窗口";
"Some apps hide their text from Accessibility. VoiceDraft can capture only that window and recognize its text on this Mac. Requires Screen Recording. The image is never saved, and macOS may ask you to confirm this permission again from time to time." = "部分应用不向辅助功能公开其文字。VoiceDraft 可以仅截取该窗口，并在这台 Mac 上识别其中的文字。需要“屏幕录制”权限。图像绝不会被保存，macOS 也可能不时请你再次确认此权限。";
"Screen Recording" = "屏幕录制";
"Screen Recording (optional)" = "屏幕录制（可选）";
"Only needed if you turn on reading windows with OCR in Settings." = "仅在你于设置中开启用 OCR 读取窗口时才需要。";
"Only the front window is captured, and only when an app exposes no text." = "仅截取前台窗口，且仅在应用不暴露文字时截取。";
"OCR is skipped until you allow it. Text from Accessibility still works. If you just allowed it, quit and reopen VoiceDraft." = "允许之前会跳过 OCR，辅助功能提供的文字仍可使用。如果你刚刚允许了此权限，请退出并重新打开 VoiceDraft。";
"Allow Screen Recording" = "允许屏幕录制";
"Screen Recording is allowed" = "已允许屏幕录制";
"Screen Recording is not allowed" = "尚未允许屏幕录制";
"Never read these apps" = "不读取这些应用";
"Password managers and VoiceDraft are always skipped." = "密码管理器和 VoiceDraft 始终会被跳过。";
"Built in" = "内置";
"App bundle ID, e.g. com.apple.mail" = "应用 Bundle ID，例如 com.apple.mail";
"Exclude" = "排除";
"Running apps" = "正在运行的应用";
"On-screen text stays in memory for at most 60 seconds. It is never written to history, saved to disk or synced. Visible text can include other people's messages, so exclude apps you do not want read." = "屏幕上的文字最多在内存中保留 60 秒，绝不会写入历史记录、保存到磁盘或同步。可见文字可能包含他人的消息，因此请排除你不希望被读取的应用。";
"On-screen context · 1 term" = "屏幕上下文 · 1 个词条";
"On-screen context · %d terms" = "屏幕上下文 · %d 个词条";
"Extract words from this screen…" = "从当前屏幕提取词汇…";
"Extract from %@" = "从 %@ 提取";
"Extract from screen" = "从屏幕提取";
"Switch to the app you want to read, then choose Extract words from this screen in the menu bar." = "请切换到要读取的应用，然后在菜单栏中选择“从当前屏幕提取词汇”。";
"%@ is excluded from on-screen context." = "%@ 已从屏幕上下文中排除。";
"Reads the text visible in %@ on this Mac, then sends only candidate words to your writing model to filter out common terms. Review the shortlist before importing." = "在这台 Mac 上读取 %@ 中可见的文字，然后仅将候选词汇发送给你的写作模型，以过滤掉常见词。导入前请先查看候选列表。";
"Reading the screen…" = "正在读取屏幕…";
"No readable text was found in this window." = "在此窗口中未找到可读取的文字。";
"No new candidate terms were found on this screen. Existing vocabulary words are excluded." = "当前屏幕上没有发现新的候选词条。词库中已有的词汇已被排除。";
"Screen · Accessibility" = "屏幕 · 辅助功能";
"Screen · OCR" = "屏幕 · OCR";
